      "content": "idk i just feel like if my blood pressure is actually high then i need more of the med to get it under control right? i dont want to wait a week for an appointment just to ask about a little dizziness. if i take two tonight it might just stabilize me faster so i dont feel lightheaded anymore. wouldnt that be better than just sitting around feeling dizzy?",
